melody:
When I was a lit-tle boy, so my moth-er told me, to me,
D5/ D5/ D5/ A4/ C5/. C5// C5/ ~A4/ G4/ G4/ F4/ G4/ A4/ C5/ C5// A4/.
way, haul a-way, we'll haul a-way, Joe!
D5 D5/ A4/ C5. A4/ G4/. G4// A4 D4.
That if I did not kiss the girls, my lips would all grow moul-dy, to me,
D5/ D5/ D5/ D5/ A4/ C5/. C5// C5/ A4/ G4/ G4/ F4/ G4/ A4/ C5/ C5// A4/.
way, haul a-way, we'll haul a-way, Joe!
